    "body": "Install with `npm install -D tsc-rs`, or download the archive for your platform.\n\n## What's Changed\n* chore: complete the third-party notices before the repo goes public by @t3dotgg in https://github.com/pingdotgg/ts-rust/pull/1\n* feat(effect): native Effect diagnostics in tsc-rs by @t3dotgg in https://github.com/pingdotgg/ts-rust/pull/4\n* feat(release): stable versions publish to latest; docs for 0.1.0 and Effect by @t3dotgg in https://github.com/pingdotgg/ts-rust/pull/5\n* fix(release): trust-setup.sh --relink for the recreated repo by @t3dotgg in https://github.com/pingdotgg/ts-rust/pull/3\n\n## New Contributors\n* @t3dotgg made their first contribution in https://github.com/pingdotgg/ts-rust/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pingdotgg/ts-rust/compare/v0.1.0-preview.2...v0.1.0",
